hi it's matthew martin from details and  earlier today we saw the louis vuitton  collection by kim jones and it was  amazing it was all about the himalayas  and mount everest basically he gave us a  unbelievably chic expedition collection  and i love that he really took a lot of  things literally and there were these  beautiful shearling jackets that were  hooded he paired them with great knits  there was wonderful suiting there was  beautiful boots it was all about the  expedition but keeping within the  vuitton parameters of ultra luxury and  ultra sheepiness in addition to  shearling coats there were these really  gorgeous shearling bags that actually  have a dual functionality and i think on  the runway they showed them as more of  like a structured bag but actually we  were fortunate enough to get a preview  and all of those bags you can open up  and make more of a casual tote another  interesting passage were all these  beautiful felted coats there was a  blazer and a couple of top coats and  felt is wonderful because it's very  light but it's incredibly warm he closed  the show with all these really wonderful  prints by the chapman brothers there was  beautiful evening jackets and there was  a pair of pajamas and there was even  more of an embroidered bag it sort of  fit the whole theme of the show  perfectly and i love those you know kim  jones always gives good show and today  was no different and it's just really  easy to be able to take each look in  each piece and be able to say oh i want  that or this is what works for me  because you know it's so relatable even  though it's just crazy fantastical ultra  luxe gorgeous like adventure that he  took us on today if you're late to this  party go to details.com for more videos  from paris and also you can check me out  on instagram and twitter at details
 

